    <gitb:version>1.0</gitb:version>
    <gitb:description>An IPS Creator actor is a system which produces/assembles/creates an IPS document. The reference patient is the IG's own all-sections example, Patricia JORDANA (identifier ABC1234): every element with a Creator obligation that the example carries must appear in the document the system produces for her.</gitb:description>
